OL,3,ABank holiday weekend to see more
OL,4,Athunderstorms and rain
OL,5,
OL,6,FMost of the UK is finally getting some
OL,7,Frain, in time for the bank holiday
OL,8,Fweekend.
OL,10,FThe weather will remain unsettled
OL,11,Facross the next few days with showers,
OL,12,Flonger spells of rain and thunderstorms
OL,13,Fall likely at times.
OL,15,FBy Monday the focus of the wet weather
OL,16,Fis likely to be across Scotland, with
OL,17,Fsunny spells developing elsewhere.
OL,19,FThe RAC estimates that 20 million trips
OL,20,Fby car will be made across the weekend
OL,21,Fin what could be challenging driving
OL,22,Fconditions.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
